  "markup": "<div class=\"canvas-card analysis-data-slide\"><div class=\"chrome-min\"><div class=\"l\">PHASE 5 · DEEP COGNITIVE ANALYSIS · INTUITIVE TEXT COMPARISON</div><div class=\"r\">20 / 37</div></div><div class=\"analysis-header-row\"><div class=\"analysis-header-left\"><h2 class=\"analysis-kicker\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.title\">文本信息量直观对比：从两段植物解说文本说起</h2><div class=\"analysis-kicker-desc\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.guide\">【直观引入】控制事实总量基本一致的前提下，对比常规表述与反常识高信息量表述</div></div><div class=\"analysis-anim-badge\" aria-label=\"Intuitive Text Animation\"><span class=\"analysis-anim-label\">TEXT INTUITION</span><svg width=\"116\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 116 30\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#eff6ff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" /><rect x=\"66\" y=\"8\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#fef2f2\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" /></svg></div></div><div class=\"analysis-body-group\"><div style=\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.45\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.ctrlPrinciple\"><strong>【实验控制原则】</strong>两组标牌传达的核心植物学事实总量保持一致（Baseline Controlled），信息熵仅作为衡量文本各片段意外程度的客观加权尺；真正随设计而变化的自变量是受众的视线分布数据。</div><span style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:12px\">BASELINE CONTROLLED</span></div><div class=\"text-heat-grid\"><div class=\"text-heat-box is-control\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);font-weight:700\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.box1.tag\">TEXT A · CONVENTIONAL TAXONOMY</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1e40af\">I = 0.415 bits</span></div><p class=\"heat-text-content\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.box1.text\">“九重葛为<span class=\"heat-mark-blue\">紫茉莉科木质藤本植物</span>，<span class=\"heat-mark-blue\">原产于南美洲</span>，<span class=\"heat-mark-blue\">夏季开花</span>，<span class=\"heat-mark-blue\">常用于园林绿化与花廊观赏</span>。”</p><div class=\"heat-stat-bar\"><span style=\"color:#1e40af;font-weight:600\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.box1.prior\">先验概率高 P_prior = 0.75</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.box1.stat\">司空见惯事实 · 知识增量极低</span></div></div><div class=\"text-heat-box is-intervention\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.box2.tag\">TEXT B · COUNTER-INTUITIVE SENSORY</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#b91c1c\">I = 3.059 bits (7.37x)</span></div><p class=\"heat-text-content\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.box2.text\">“你以为红艳艳的是花瓣？<span class=\"heat-mark-red\">其实那是它的『苞片』！</span><span class=\"heat-mark-blue\">中间细小白色才是真花</span>。<span class=\"heat-mark-red\">请用手指触摸它如纸般干爽的触感</span>。”</p><div class=\"heat-stat-bar\"><span style=\"color:#b91c1c;font-weight:600\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.box2.prior\">先验概率低 P_prior = 0.12</span><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:600\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.box2.stat\">颠覆预期反常识 · 知识增量激增 7.37 倍</span></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border-subtle);padding:14px 22px;border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><div style=\"font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.45\" data-i18n=\"slides.s18a.summary\"><strong>直观发现：</strong>字数相当、事实受控的两段文字，因受众先验心理预期的不同，所释放的有效信息量呈现出几何级数的巨大差异。</div><span style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700\">INFORMATION DENSITY</span></div></div></div>"
